# glossa
===
 Fast, small desktop translator: select text anywhere, press a hotkey, read the translation by the cursor. OCR with Google Lens, dictionaries, AI translators, modules in any language. Clean-room successor to QTranslate, in Rust. Windows, macOS, Linux..
